{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228","name":"Charge","source":{"id":"source:reference-ff9f88ce353a2228","title":"Charge","revision":18026,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:27:58Z","sha256":"c1204f2cff0dd1010cb8cb20a47d62c0c4cbb315a6df3ec70fa9f094fd8ac3c8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18026","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Charge&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ff9f88ce353a2228","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," you can move your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," (minimum 2 squares) in a straight line, and then make a melee attack at the end of your movement. You gain a +2 competence bonus on your attack roll, but take a -2 penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You cannot Charge through low objects or squares occupied by opponents (allies do not hinder your Charge), and Charging through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"}," costs twice as much per square as normal. You cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tumble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tumble"}," during your movement as a part of a Charge. After you resolve a Charge, you can take no further ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," this turn (although other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," can be taken prior to the Charge).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"},", you can make a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," check to Charge through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low Objects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low_Objects"},". If you fail this check, you cannot attack at the end of your movement. You can combine this with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cross Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cross_Difficult_Terrain"}," application; however, the DC increases to 35.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mass Combat"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Commander","referenceId":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83"}," can order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Charge, moving toward an enemy and making an attack in one Action. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," moves up to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," and then makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," in the same square or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," within weapon range.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Charging ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," gains a +2 bonus on its attack roll but takes a -2 penalty to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of its next turn. If a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Commander","referenceId":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83"}," orders a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Charge, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," cannot order the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to attack until the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
